WEBVTT

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:08.190
Children need to spend more time doing 
things together with their fathers.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:12.240
Unfortunately, the father is apt to come home

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.030
wanting most of all to slump down...

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.540
Shimada, what is this?

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.370
Oh, um...

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.740
Asahi lent it to me.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.130
I said "no thanks," but...

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.800
You believe him just like that?!

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.310
I, er...

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:33.080
K-Kuromine-kun...

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.140
What?!

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:35.860
No! I, um...

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.380
I'm taking this.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.770
Aizawa, you take care of these two...

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:43.520
Where's Aizawa?

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.010
I thought I saw Aizawa-san during break.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.580
Her stuff is still here,

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.880
and she hasn't handed in 
an early dismissal form.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.610
Does anyone know?

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:55.360
<i>The class rep...</i>

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:58.120
<i>Where did she go?</i>

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.770
All right, quiet down.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:01.950
Let's get back to class.

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:06.330
Rearrange these words so 
the sentence makes sense.

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:08.170
Shimada.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.130
Come up front.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.260
What? But Asahi...

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:15.970
<i>C-Class Rep?!</i>

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:50.020
<b>Help the Class Rep!</b>

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.180
Help the Class Rep!

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:51.760
<i>Class Rep?!</i>

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:52.940
<i>What are you doing?!</i>

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.280
Leave the classroom?

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:05.570
S-Sensei.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:06.910
What is it, Kuromine?

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:10.390
Um, m-may I go to the bathroom?

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.170
I-I'm about to mess myself.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.690
You look like you'll last a little longer.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:17.630
Just hold it.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.920
N-No, I mean, um...

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.130
I mean, number two.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.050
Seriously?!

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:25.820
Fine.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:26.680
You may go.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.100
Sensei, I gotta go, too.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:30.660
You hurry up and answer the question.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.900
I apologize for causing you embarrassment.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.130
I needed to ask you to help with the recharge.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.990
Recharge? Recharge what?

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:44.550
My external unit's battery 
is depleted. It won't move.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:47.170
The bigger Class Rep was battery-powered?!

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.080
But it looks so high-tech.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.840
It's your fault to begin with.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:55.570
I was trying to recharge during break.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:56.540
But...

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:59.050
It's time.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.520
That was awesome.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.260
Thanks, Kuromine-kun.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:07.930
I'm glad you enjoyed it.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:11.930
<i>Awesome? What is she talking about?</i>

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.290
But man, five times all 
the way until morning...

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.020
I'm exhausted now.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.690
<i>E-Exhausted after five times, you say?!</i>

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.190
<i>D-Did those two actually...</i>

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.610
I was so nervous at first,

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.770
but by the end I was like, "This feels great!"

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.580
It was that good, huh?

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:31.080
I'd like to go once more, if we have time.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.700
I missed my chance to recharge,

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.510
thanks to your lewd conversation.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.420
Lewd?

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:46.720
I had no idea your relationship 
had progressed that far.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.010
What?

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.390
If you mean what we talked 
about during the break,

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.310
I think we were just talking 
about watching a DVD.

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:55.060
DVD?

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.350
Yeah, I lent her a DVD,

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.520
<b>This party will become a war zone!
Dairambo</b>

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:01.270
and apparently she watched it 
five times before morning.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:03.070
So that's why she was exhausted.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:07.460
Class Rep, just what did you think it was?

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:08.580
Ask no more!

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:09.530
Whoa, watch it!

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.330
F-Fine!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.290
So where's the bigger Class Rep?

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:18.170
Here.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:20.100
Are you serious?

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:22.060
I have to go into the girls' bathroom?

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.080
I apologize.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.990
After careful consideration,

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:27.430
I decided this was the best place to hide it.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.080
All right.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.400
I'll have to do it.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:40.440
<b>Keep the bathroom clean</b>

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:40.440
Everyone's in class, so it'll be okay, right?

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:44.000
Thank you. It's the last stall at the end.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.410
I'm sorry!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.530
What are you doing?

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.020
That's my external unit!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.750
Oh, right.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:05:59.790
What is it?

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.750
Um, I hope you flushed.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.160
I only chose this place as a hiding spot!

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.650
How rude of you!

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:08.080
Sorry!

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.650
Up we go.

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.310
<i>It actually has body heat.</i>

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:19.810
<i>Is that because it hasn't been that 
long since the battery ran out?</i>

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:22.980
<i>It even feels, like, well...</i>

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:24.660
<i>Soft...</i>

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.360
Ow!

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.780
I-I know I'm the one asking you for help,

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:32.000
but could you please stop staring like that?

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.540
Wait, did you just shoot me?

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:46.680
Class Rep, why don't you ride on me?

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.470
Get in my pocket or something.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.650
I mean, wouldn't it be bad if 
someone saw you like that?

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:52.860
N-No, thanks.

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:55.070
I can't ask you to do that much.

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:57.850
Besides, class is in session. 
It'll be fine. Probably.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.600
Yeah?

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.480
<i>I feel strange.</i>

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.460
<i>As though I'm the one being held.</i>

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.360
<i>Stop leaning on him like that, me!</i>

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.700
<i>N-No!</i>

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.940
<i>Stay calm, Aizawa Nagisa.</i>

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:15.910
Oh, no! Hurry, Kuromine Asahi!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:16.670
Right.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.120
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:24.610
<i>Okay.</i>

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:28.220
<i>Someone's coming.</i>

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:37.930
Kuromine-kun?

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.680
Oh, it's you, Shiragami.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.830
Is that Aizawa-san?

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:48.550
You're pretty bold, skipping 
class to do <i>that</i>, Kuromine-kun.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:49.870
N-No!

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:50.960
You've got it wrong!

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:52.450
You don't have to explain.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.720
I get it. I'm a master of relationships...

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:56.530
Ow.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:59.910
You couldn't be more 
mistaken, Shiragami Youko!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.790
Mini Aizawa-san?

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.790
<b>No running in the hallways! It's dangerous!</b>

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.790
Oh, so that's what you were doing.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:09.090
Even someone as together 
as you makes mistakes, huh?

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:10.980
N-Never mind that.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:13.380
Could you go please check to 
see if there's anyone inside?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.280
Roger.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.100
Excuse me.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:22.450
The nurse isn't here.

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.100
All right, let's go in.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.040
Kuromine Asahi.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:34.180
I cannot thank you enough.

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:35.290
You have my gratitude.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:38.200
Nah, I didn't do much.

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:42.230
Would you mind pulling this over 
to that socket and plugging it in?

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.660
Sure.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.790
That's it?

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:48.760
Yes, thank you.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.490
That's so old-school.

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:58.570
Are you going somewhere, Class Rep?

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.770
Wouldn't you be safer here?

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:04.770
That may be, but I must 
afford you a safe escape.

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:08.520
I could not bear for there to be 
any bad rumors spread about you

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:11.330
should you be seen leaving an 
empty nurse's room together.

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.020
Leave it to me.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:15.190
I'll go check.

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:17.530
Wait here until I say it's safe.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.420
Roger.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.130
All right.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.280
That was a surprise.

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:25.470
But I guess it's all good now.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:29.960
Mikan!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.840
M-Mikan, what happened?

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:37.970
I just... found a tiny Aizawa-san.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.680
Shiragami, your wings! Your wings!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.340
A figure.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:47.140
It's a figure, right?

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.150
<i>She's pretending to be a figure?</i>

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:53.730
<i>I guess as long as she doesn't 
move, she can fool her.</i>

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:55.600
<i>She's probably saluting</i>

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:58.410
<i>because it's how she feels most 
comfortable standing still.</i>

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:02.610
<i>I have to get her before she 
can't hold the pose anymore.</i>

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:06.370
Wait, are figures supposed 
to look this realistic?

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.700
And why Aizawa-san?

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.080
It even has a weird antenna.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.630
I-It can't be...

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.010
Can't be? You can't mean...

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:19.720
Is Aizawa-san the fabled Hallway Fairy of 
the Seven Wonders of the School Campus?

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.810
No! Of course not!

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:24.980
<i>Wait, why are you moving with us, Class Rep?!</i>

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:25.770
Huh?

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.040
I thought I just saw this figure move.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.310
You're imagining it!

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:32.260
A figure, huh?

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.410
<i>Nailed it!</i>

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.990
<i>What a proud salute!</i>

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:44.510
<i>Look at her satisfied face.</i>

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.370
<i>She knows she nailed it!</i>

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.280
<i>You can see it in her salute, too.</i>

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:54.090
Um, did this figure just land on its own?

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.580
Of course not.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:59.010
<i>Whether she nailed it 
or not wasn't the issue!</i>

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.160
I'm pretty sure I saw it move.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:05.620
<i>Th-This is bad. I have 
to divert her attention.</i>

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:07.430
So it really is the Hallway Fairy?

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.140
<i>I know.</i>

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:13.310
Mikan, what other Wonders of 
the School Campus are there?

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:17.190
Well, from what I've researched...

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:20.110
First, there's the Hallway Fairy.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.780
Then there's the ephemeral Horned Lady.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.450
The Pervert of Light.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.030
<i>Good, I got her attention.</i>

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:30.710
Oh, yeah, there's also the 
After School Vampire.

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:32.010
What?

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:33.470
Do you guys know something about it?

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:34.420
Nope!

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.710
Nothing at all!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:36.710
Oh, darn.

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:40.420
This sure is a well-made figure, though.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.550
What the hell are you doing, Mikan?!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:44.570
Huh?

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.880
Isn't checking for panties the 
first thing you do with a figure?

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:49.760
Don't flip the class rep's skirt just  
because that's the first thing you do!

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.550
Why are you reacting like that?

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:52.880
It's a figure, right?

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:53.940
It sure is a figure!

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:57.700
<i>Class Rep handled that well, though...</i>

00:11:57.700 --> 00:11:58.980
<i>Wait...</i>

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.950
<i>She's glaring daggers at me.</i>

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:01.920
Eromine-kun.

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:02.770
Me?!

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.030
It's <i>my</i> fault?!

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:10.040
<i>But still, even Mikan wouldn't take 
it further than lifting her skirt.</i>

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:13.220
Hey, it's Heathen Queen Mikan-san.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:14.750
What's that?

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.790
I found an Aizawa-san figure.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.180
I was lifting its skirt.

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:18.880
Seriously?!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.170
Let me lift it, too!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.970
<i>Shimada!</i>

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.840
That's the normal thing to do, right?

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:24.970
It's a figure, after all.

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:27.570
<i>What a tragic salute!</i>

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:30.180
<i>She's like a soldier marching to her death!</i>

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.980
It looks like all its clothes come off, too.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.350
Whoever made it must be a pervert.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.330
Seriously?!

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.690
Let me see it!

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:39.150
<i>God, what do I do?!</i>

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:42.810
<i>I have to save the class rep, fast!</i>

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:49.030
<b>Doesn't that device erase memories?</b>

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:49.030
<b>Tap tap</b>

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:49.030
<b>Hey, not bad♥</b>

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:57.520
C-Can I see that figure, too?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.430
Wh-What's up with that reaction?

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:03.090
E-Eromine-kun...

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:06.210
Right after you heard that its clothes 
come off? What are you thinking?!

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:07.650
You're that shocked?!

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:09.810
Wait, why are you shocked too, Shiragami?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.970
<i>Class Rep, you too?!</i>

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.900
<i>Wait. Please, wait. Think about it!</i>

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.320
Asahi, I get her first.

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.770
Stay out of this!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:18.730
Mikan, here.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.480
Eromine-kun...

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.940
No! I can't let you have this!

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:24.340
Me, then!

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:26.310
Um... Oh, yeah!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:28.540
I made that figure.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:31.090
So it doesn't matter that I can 
undress it. Just give it back!

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:31.660
What?!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.080
You'd tell such an obvious lie just to have it?!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.540
He's a pervert! A pervert!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.820
It had the opposite effect?!

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:38.630
And again, why you too, Shiragami?!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.130
Wait, what the hell?!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.410
Damn, Asahi!

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:43.220
Make me one, too!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.880
Shima, you stay out of this!

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:50.300
So, what? You're telling me <i>you</i> made 
this intricately-detailed Aizawa-san?

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.220
Y-Yeah, that's right.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:55.360
Make me one of her in gym 
clothes, not her uniform.

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:58.270
You've been fantasizing and undressing 
her with your eyes all the time?!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.730
W-Well...

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.110
Or did you lie because you just
want to take its clothes off?!

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.560
Yeah, that's right!

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:06.960
I made it after lots of fantasizing 
and undressing her with my eyes!

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:08.800
You really are an Eromine-kun!

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.280
Just give it back! It's mine!

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.390
Asahi, you took it by force?!

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.290
Wait, Asahi!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.860
I'll let you be the first to 
borrow my new adult mags!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:19.440
I won't say anything about 
your weird fetishes,

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.750
but a figure of your classmate?!

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.630
Say whatever you want!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:27.590
I-It's okay! I understand, Eromine-kun!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.850
Yeah, I get that you totally <i>don't</i> understand!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:35.160
Wh-What do you intend to 
do with me, Eromine Asahi?!

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:36.730
Maybe I should stop saving you!

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:38.770
Sorry.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.560
You bore the sullied name 
of Eromine Asahi to save me.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.190
Don't be so frank about 
calling it a sullied name!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:51.340
Well, at least you understand.

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:53.860
You wouldn't believe how 
lonely a battle it was.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.330
I'm really sorry.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:57.830
I was scared.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.810
I thought it was all over.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.290
And you...

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.250
Really, thank you.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:08.040
O-Oh, well, you can thank 
me when you're in the clear.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:08.040
Is it the gym clothes?

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.210
Is it because I asked for gym clothes?

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:13.040
I wouldn't mind her being in 
nothing but an apron, either.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.640
And now I'm the one being chased?!

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:24.370
This is getting interesting.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:40.710
Stop it, before Aizawa-san herself finds out!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.420
You can have three of my 
top-secret adult mags!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.420
Heck, you can have whichever one you want!

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:47.760
You can still turn back, Eromine-kun!

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:49.980
Shiragami...

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:51.300
I'm truly sorry.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.220
No, it's fine.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:56.670
It's better than having your secret 
outed and you having to leave.

00:15:57.630 --> 00:16:01.690
Anyway, hide here until they give up.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.530
<i>I-It's warm.</i>

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:07.650
<i>I feel Kuromine Asahi's body heat.</i>

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:11.500
<i>Our heartbeats are overlapping.</i>

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:14.960
<i>Wait, no!</i>

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:15.850
<i>No!</i>

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:17.780
<i>What the hell am I thinking 
at a time like this?!</i>

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:20.690
<i>First of all, I rejected Kuromine Asahi!</i>

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:21.410
<i>And now—</i>

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:25.250
I should block the entrance, just in case.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.630
Up we go.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:34.460
It's heavy!

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.640
A-Are you okay, Class Rep?

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.100
Y-Yeah.

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:42.240
Everything's fine.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.850
Huh? What the?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.730
When did the bigger Class Rep get here?

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.380
What are you talking about?

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:50.830
The external unit's still rechargi—

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:52.570
Wait, what?!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.410
Why am I bigger?

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:59.450
<i>L-Little Class Rep turned 
into Bigger Class Rep!</i>

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:01.900
H-How did this happen?!

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:04.410
This has never happened before.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.650
<i>She doesn't know, either?</i>

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:09.090
<i>Huh? But...</i>

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.410
<i>Aside from being bigger,</i>

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:14.470
<i>she's not really any different 
from how she usually is.</i>

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.930
<i>What's that?</i>

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:21.390
Wh-What are you staring at, Eromine Asahi?!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.430
<i>It's something I get called "Eromine" for?!</i>

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:26.850
But haven't you had that 
out in the open all this time?

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:30.820
O-Out in the open? How dare you speak 
of a woman's antenna like that?!

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.610
A-Antenna?!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.080
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.620
I'm ignorant when it comes to aliens.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.690
I apologize, as well.

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:42.370
I shouldn't have called 
out an Earthling about it.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:44.370
<i>That's right.</i>

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:48.630
<i>It just wasn't so conspicuous 
until now, given my size.</i>

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:52.080
<i>But there's no way I can tell him that</i>

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:56.340
<i>this antenna glows only 
during courtship rituals.</i>

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:59.620
Anyway, now that you're bigger,

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.990
we might get some odd looks 
if people see us here.

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:05.020
Let's move before the others get back.

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:06.320
Can you stand?

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:10.060
Y-Yeah.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.730
Thanks.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.910
A-Are you okay, Class Rep?

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:24.980
Sorry.

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.450
I couldn't hold you up.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.350
<i>Kuromine Asahi's face is so close to me!</i>

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:35.130
<i>Wh-What is this feeling, 
like my chest is about to burst?</i>

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:37.800
Did you just hear something 
from over this way?

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.640
Oh, yeah, we haven't checked 
the storage room yet.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:42.180
This is bad.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:44.260
If the others see us like this...

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:46.390
Damn it. What do we do?

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.490
Hey, are you in there, Asahi?

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:50.900
I'm opening the door.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:51.600
Huh?

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.100
It won't open.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:54.940
So he <i>is</i> in here.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:57.340
You've been hiding in here, 
haven't you, Asahi?

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:59.780
Now give it up and open this door!

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.710
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:04.770
She's right! No fair hogging the fun!

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:06.200
Let me flip its skirt, too!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:09.540
Class Rep, I have a good idea.

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:11.400
Give it up already!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.120
You sore loser!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.670
He's right, Kuromine-kun.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:19.670
You're right that we might be able 
to get out of here that way.

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:22.340
But if I did that, you'd be...

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:24.000
Don't worry about me.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.350
B-But...

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:28.060
This is the only way to 
protect you, Class Rep.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:29.700
Just hurry!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.040
Asahi!

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:36.480
This is getting us nowhere!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:38.720
We'll have to body-slam the door open!

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:40.860
All right.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.410
Ready, and...

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.900
Asahi?!

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.330
Kuromine-kun?

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:52.530
Absolutely despicable.

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.230
Aizawa-san?

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:56.000
I thought you were in the nurse's office.

00:19:56.580 --> 00:20:02.510
I overheard you talking about my figure 
in front of the nurse's office.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.860
I punished Kuromine Asahi with an iron fist.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:09.020
A-And the figure?!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:10.880
I confiscated it and destroyed it.

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:11.730
Destroyed?!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.300
I apologize for the commotion.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:14.730
Goodbye.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.040
Asahi!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:18.250
You were supposed to protect it!

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:21.270
My dream... <i>Our </i>dream!

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:23.820
The pitiful end of the perverted figure men.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.100
This'll be great for the newspaper!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:29.140
<i>Kuromine Asahi, I'm sorry.</i>

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.080
I suppose that was entertaining enough.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:38.040
I should return her to normal.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:45.850
I thought I saw something small move.

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:47.060
Yikes.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:49.310
Like one of the Seven Wonders?

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:52.810
Oh, so that's what it was, huh?

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:56.190
So you weren't an Eromine-kun 
after all, Kuromine-kun.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.440
O-Of course not.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:01.020
<i>I guess I should just be glad 
that I set things straight.</i>

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:03.030
Hey, Kuromine-kun,

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.450
lend me more DVDs, okay?

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.020
Sure.

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:10.680
Which one do you want next?

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:16.030
<i>I'm glad my identity wasn't revealed.</i>

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:22.030
<i>But why is it that even though 
their relationship is repaired,</i>

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:24.720
<i>I feel not a shred of joy?</i>

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.510
Now, hit me.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:30.430
But if I did that, you'd be...

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.180
This is the only way to 
protect you, Class Rep.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:37.940
<i>What am I doing, dwelling on memories?</i>

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:41.460
<i>I'm supposed to be calm and collected.</i>

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:47.330
<i>But what is this fuzzy 
feeling I'm experiencing?</i>

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:25.590
<b>Shimada's Love Compatibility Test</b>

00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:23.980
Shimada's Love Compatibility Test!

00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:25.590
There's no way this can be good.

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:29.570
Pick a fruit to find out 
who you should be with!

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:31.510
I'll go with peach.

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:32.820
I choose cherries.

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:34.640
If you chose peach,

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:38.360
your best choice is me, the clean 
and peachy-bottomed Shimada.

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:40.180
Wait, why are you undressing?!

00:23:40.650 --> 00:23:43.150
And if you chose cherry,

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:48.070
your best choice is me, pure and 
untouched Mr. Cherry Shimada.

00:23:45.250 --> 00:23:48.070
<b>Next Episode:
"Let's Go on a... Date?"</b>

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:50.990
Shima!
